<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1 Timothea</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timothea</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Timothea</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timothea</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timothea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Paula, min chhandamtu Pathian leh kan beisei innghahna Krista Isua thupêk anga Krista Isua tirhkoh hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />rinnaa ka fa tak tak Timothe, chibai ka bûk a che. Pa Pathian leh Krista Isua kan Lalpa hnên ata khawngaihna te, zahngaihna te, remna te i hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Makedonia rama ka kal dâwn laia ka ngen ang che khân Efesi khuaa awm zêl tûrin ka ngên leh a che. Mi ṭhenkhat thurin dik lo zirtîr ṭhînte kha khap la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />khâng thawnthu leh thlahtute chhui vak vak kha bântîr rawh, inhnialna a titam mai mai a, rinna vânga hriat ṭhin, Pathian thiltum chu mi a hriat fiahtîr chuang si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thinlung thianghlim, chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang leh rinna dik tak aṭanga chhuak hmangaihna chu a lo pun zâwk theih nân he thu hi ka pe che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chuan chu chu an pênsan a, inhnialna sâwt lo lamah an lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dân zirtîrtu berah an inngai a, an thu sawi awmzia leh ngam taka an thil sawi ṭhinte chu an hre tak tak si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dân hi a hmanna tûr taka hman a nih chuan a ṭha tih kan hria,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />mi ṭhate chunga lek tûr a ni lo tih hriat tûr a ni: Dân pawisa lo te leh luhlul te, sakhaw ngaihsak lo leh mi sual te, serh leh sâng nei lo leh bawlhhlawh te, nu leh pa thattu te leh tual that te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />inngaih chîng te leh mawngkawhur te, mihring rûk chîng te leh dawthei te, dâwta chhechham chîng te leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />fak tlâk Pathianin puan tûra mi kawltîr Chanchin Ṭha ropui kalha zirtîr chîng te chunga lek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tichaktu, rin tlâka mi ngaia he hna atâna mi ruattu Krista Isua, kan Lalpa chu lâwmthu ka hrilh a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tûn hma khân a sawichhetu, tiduhdahtu leh hmusittu lo ni mah ila, ringtu ka la ni lo va; hre lova ti ṭhîn ka nih avângin ka chungah zah a ngai êm êm ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kan Lalpa khawngaihna chuan Krista Isuaa rinna leh hmangaihnain mi vûr khat ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Krista Isua chu mi sualte chhandam tûrin khawvêlah a lo kal tih hi a dikin a va pawm tlâk êm! Kei hi an zînga sual ber ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mahse, hemi avâng hian khawngaihna ka dawng, Krista Isua chuan ka chunga a dawhtheihzia a tilang hmasa hi, tûn hnu pawha amah ringtu apiangin, chatuan nun an nei thei dâwn tih entîrna a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalber, chatuan mi, thi thei lo, mita hmuh theih loh, Pathian tak chauh hnênah chuan chawimawina leh ropuina chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka fapa Timothe, hêng thupêk hi ka kawltîr a che; zâwlneiten i chungchâng an sawi lâwk kha hre reng la, chûng thu chu hmangin indona ṭha chu bei rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />rinna leh chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang vawng tlat ang che; mi ṭhenkhatten an chhia leh ṭha hriatna an hnâwl a, an rinna chu a keh chhe zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng mite zîngah chuan Humenaia leh Aleksandara pawh an tel a, Pathian pawi sawi an sim nân thunun an ngai a, Setana ka pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka chah duh hmasak ber che chu thil dîlna te, ṭawngṭaina te, dîlsakna te, lâwmthu hrilhna te mi zawng zawng tân hlân ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak leh zahawma awmin thlamuang taka kan khawsak ho dial dial theih nân lalber leh thuneitu zawng zawng pawh dîlsak rawh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />chu chu min chhandamtu Pathian hmuhin a ṭha a, a lâwmzâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan mi zawng zawng chhandama awmah leh thutak hria atân a duh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian pakhat chauh a awm a, Pathian leh mihring inkârah palai pakhat chauh a awm bawk, mihring Krista Isua chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng tlan nân ani chu a inpe a, chhandamna thu chu hun a tih takah a rawn puang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei hi, Jentail-te hnêna chu rinna thu chu puang tûr leh thutak zirtîrtu leh tirhkoh atân ruat ka ni; he ka thu sawi hi thutak a ni a, dâwt a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, in inkhâwmna apiangah mipaho chuan tihtakzetin, thinur chung leh ringhlel chunga ti lovin kut thianghlim pharin ṭawngṭai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeichhia pawh a mawi tâwk leh inchawih tâwkin inchei sela, sam chei lêrh te, rangkachaka inchei te, tuikeplung ṭhi awrh te, puan man tam inbel te chîng suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak hmeichhiate tih âwm rêng, thil tih ṭhatein inthuam zâwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhiate chuan ngawi rengin, thu awih takin thil an zir tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmeichhiain an zirtîr te, mipa chunga thu an neih te ka phal lo, ngawih an chuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adama chu Evi ai chuan siam hmasak a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />buma awm kha Adama a ni lo va, hmeichhia kha a ni buma awm leh bawhchhetu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, rinnaah te, hmangaihnaah te, thianghlimnaah te, mawi taka an awm reng phawt chuan fa hrin avângin chhandam an ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu pawh kohhran hotu hnathawh duh chuan hna ṭha thawh a duh a ni tih hi a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, kohhran hotu ni tûr chu sawisêlbo, nupui pakhat nei, insûm thei, rilru fîm, mi zahawm, mi inphal leh zirtîr thiam a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zu in chîng lo, kut thlâk mai chîng lo, mi nunnêm, inrem duh mi leh tangka sum ngaina lo mi a ni tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />zahawm taka chhûngkaw khawsak rêla, fate kîlkawi thiam mi a ni bawk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mahni chhûngkaw rêl fel thiam si lo chuan engtin nge Pathian kohhran a enkawl theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ring thar mi ni suh se, chuti lo chu a chapo vang a, Diabola angin thiam loh a chang ve dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pâwn lam mite ngaihsân a ni bawk tûr a ni; tichuan, hmingchhiat hlawhin Diabola thangah a âwk dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin kohhran rawngbâwltute pawh mi zahawm, mi rilru nghet an ni tûr a ni, zu heh leh bawlhhlawh taka hlêp duh mi an ni tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />chhia leh ṭha hriatna thianga rinna thu ril chelh tlat mi an ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />En fiah hmasak phawt tûr an ni a, mi tling tâwk an nih chuan rawng an bâwl chauh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeichhiate pawh chutiang bawkin mi zahawm, mi rêl chîng lo, insûm thei, kawng engkima mi rinawm an ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rawngbâwltute chu nupui pakhat nei, fate leh chhûngkaw enkawl thiam mi an ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rawng bâwl ṭhate chu an chan a ṭha tial tial ang a, Krista Isua rinnaah pawh an huai telh telh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He lehkha ka ziak lai hian lo kala hmuh thuai che ka inbeisei reng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mahse, ka lo tlai palh tâkin Pathian chhûngkua, Pathian nung kohhran, thutak kengkawhtute chu eng anga awm tûr nge an nih i hriat theih nân ka han ziak a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan sakhaw thurûk rilzia hi hnial rual a ni lo ve: Ani chu tisa puin a lo lang a, Thlarauvin a dikzia a tilang a, Vântirhkohte pawhin an hmu a, hnam tin zîngah puan darh a ni a, khawvêl puma miin an ring a, Ropui taka lâk chhoh a ni ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hun hnuhnûngah chuan miten rinna thu hi an la hawisan ang a, thlarau dik lo hruai bovin, ramhuai laka chhuak zirtîrna dik lo chu an la awih zâwk dâwn tih thlarauvin chiang takin a sawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûng thu theh darhtute chu chhia leh ṭha hriatna del, thîr linga deh châr ang, mi dawthei an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inneih te leh thil ṭhenkhat ei te an khap a. Thutak hre tawh ringtute erawh chuan lâwmthu sawi chunga ei atân Pathian siam a ni tih an hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian thil siam tinrêngte hi a ṭha a, eng mah duh loh tûr a ni lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />lâwmthu sawi chunga dawn mai tûr a ni, Pathian thu leh ṭawngṭainaa hlan thianghlim vek a ni tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hêng kaihhruainate hi unaute hrilh la, Krista Isua rawngbâwltu ṭha in ni dâwn nia; rinna thu leh zirtîrna ṭha i zawm ṭhin khân thlarau lamah a ṭhan lentîr zêl bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thawnthu dukdak lo mai mai chu hawisan la, thlarau lam thilah insawizawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Taksaa insawizawi hi a sâwt ngawt mai, thlarau lama insawizawina erawh chu kawng engkimah a ṭangkai a, tûn dam chhûng leh nakin hun atân a sâwt êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />He thu hi a dik a, pawm tlâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian nung chu kan beisei innghahna a nih tâk avângin kan thawk rim a, kan bei nasa a ni. Ani chu mi zawng zawng tân chhandamtu a ni a, ringtute tân a ni ber nghe nghe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng thu hi pe la, zirtîr zui zêl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I naupan avâng maiin tu man ngainêp che suh se, thu sawiah te, chêtziaah te, hmangaihnaah te, rinnaah te, thianghlimnaah te ringtute entawn tlâkin awm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lo kal hma chu vântlâng zînga Pathian thu chhiar te, thu hril te, zirtîr te lo uar rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Upahovin i chunga kut an nghah laia zâwlneite sawi anga thlarau lam thilpêk i dawnte kha thlahthlam suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmang zui zêl la, tuina berah neih la; tichuan, mi tinin i ṭhan zêlzia an hmu dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I thil tih leh i zirtîrah fîmkhur hle la, hêng hi ti zêl la, nangmah leh i thu ngaithlatute i chhandam dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa zâwkte chu hau suh la, mahni pa anga enin a ngenin ngên zâwk ang che; naupang zâwkte chu nau angin en la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pitarte chu nu angin en la, nulate chu thianghlim takin farnu angin en ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahni chauhva awm hmeithaite chu zah la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tu leh fa nei hmeithaite chu, an tu leh fate chuan Pathianin chhûngkaw mawhphurhna a pêk chu hlen chhuah zir phawt sela, anmahni châwm liantu chu châwm ve thung rawh se, chu chu Pathian lâwm zâwng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Châwmtu nei lo, mahni chauhva hmeithai chuan, Pathian chauh rinchhan tûr a nei a, ṭanpuina dîlin a chhûn a zân a ṭawngṭai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmeithai leplêrh tak erawh chu, a dam lai pawhin mitthi mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng kaihhruainate hi hrilh la, sawisêlbovin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahni chhûngte, in khata awmpui ngei châwm duh lo an awm chuan, rinna hi an phatsan ta tihna a ni, ringlo mi aiin an sual zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum sawmruk la tling lo chu hmeithai zîngah ziak tel suh; pasal pakhat chauh nei, thil ṭha tih kawnga fak kai, fate lo enkawl tlei tawh, mikhual chunga ṭha, mi thianghlimte ke sil ṭhîn, mi mangang ṭanpui peih, thil ṭha tih kawnga inpe mi an ni bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmeithai la nula deuhte chu telh suh, an châkna avângin Krista hawisana pasal neih an duh leh si ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an thu lo tiam tawh an bawhchhiat avângin sawisêl an kai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu lovah pawh, mi ina an lên kualna lamah dâwngdah an zir a, dâwngdah mai pawh ni lovin mi rêl an chîng a, thu veivir an hrât a, an sawi loh tûr tûr an sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, hmeithai la nula deuhte chuan pasal nei leh se ka ti a ni, fate neiin chhûngkua enkawl sela, hmêlmaten min sawichhiatna tûr rêng an nei dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat chu Setana zuiin an pêng sual tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ringtu hmeichhiain, an chhûngkaw zîngah hmeithai nei se a châwm tûr a ni; mahnia hmeithaite chauh kohhranin an enkawl theih nân kohhran chu phurrit siamsak suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kohhran upa, mi hruai thiam, thu hril leh zirtîr lama taima bîkte chu a leh hniha chawimawi tlâk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “Bâwngpain buh a chîl laiin a hmui phuar suh; hna thawktu chu hlawh hmu tlâk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Upa an hêkna chu thuhretu pahnih emaw, pathum emaw tal an awm loh chuan pawm suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil tisual ngeite chu vântlâng hmaah zilh rawh, mi dang pawhin an hlauh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian leh Krista Isua leh a vântirhkoh thlante hmaah thu ka pe a che: ngaih dân nei sa lovin, hleih nei lovin hêng thu hi kengkawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rawngbâwltu tûr nemngheh hmanhmawh lutuk suh la, mahni invawng thianghlim rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tui chauh in tawh lo la, na i nei fo si a, i pum nawm nân uain tlêm in ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat sualna chu a langsâr a, thiam loh chantîr nghâl theih a ni; ṭhenkhat sualna erawh chu rei fe hnuah lo chuan a lang nghâl mai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin thiltih ṭha chu a langsâr a, langsâr lo mah se, thup reng theih a ni chuang lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh, bawih nghâwngkawl bâtte chuan an pute chu kawng engkimah an zah tûr a ni, chuti lo chu Pathian hming leh kan zirtîrna hi sawichhiat a ni dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawih, Kristian pu neite chuan rinnaa unau an nih denchhenin an pute chu an ngainêp tûr a ni lo, ṭha lehzualin rawng an bâwlsak zâwk tûr a ni; an rawngbâwlsakte nên rinna leh hmangaihnaa chhûngkhat an ni si a. Hêng hi i zirtîra, i fuihna tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu pawh kan Lalpa Isua Krista thutak leh sakhaw zirtîrna thu dik chu kalha zirtîrna danglam zirtîr chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mi â, intivei tak, eng mah hre si lo an ni; sawihnâwm tûr zawn thiam tak, inhnial châk hliah hliah, inîtsîkna te, innghirnghona te, Pathian pawi sawi te leh thu inchuh tâwpintai nei lo chawk chhuaktu an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />rilru chhe tawh, thu dik man pha tawh lo, sakhua hi hausak nâna hman tumte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mahni ta-a lungawite tân chuan sakhaw mi nih hi a hlâwk êm êm rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawvêlah hian eng mah kan luhpui lo va, eng mah kan chhuahpui thei dâwn bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ei tûr leh silh tûr kan neih chuan kan tân a tâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hausak duh mite chu thlêmnaah an lût a, duhâmna âtthlâk, thang hlauhawm takah chuan an âwk a, an chhiat phah a, an boral ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangka sum ngainat hi sual tinrêng bul a ni, sum ngah an tumna lamah ṭhenkhat chuan rinna hi an pênsan a, lungngaih sawi sên lohvin mahni an intina ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang, Pathian mi, chûng chu tlânsan la, dikna te, sakhaw ngaihsakna te, rinna te, hmangaihna te, dawhtheihna te, nunnêmna te neih tum tlat zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rinna hlu tak hi ṭanin theihtâwp chhuah ang che; chatuan nun chu vuan tlat la, chumi chang tûr chuan koh i ni a, hretu tam tak hmaah rinna hi i pawm thu i puan kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Engkim nunna hnâr, Pathian leh Krista Isua, Pontia Pilata hmaa hlau hlek lova thu dik ṭan tlattu hmaah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />i tih tûra ruat chu rinawm taka ti tûrin thu ka pe a che. Kan Lalpa Isua Krista lo lan leh hma chu bawlhhlawh kai lo leh sawisêlbovin awm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Fak tlâk Pathian, engkim chunga thu neitu awm chhun, lalberte Lalber, lalte Lal chuan a hun takah Krista chu a rawn lantîr dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amah chauh hi thi thei lo, hnaih theih rual loh ênga chêng, tu ma la hmuh loh leh hmuh theih loh ni bawk chu a ni, a hnênah chuan chawimawina leh thiltihtheihna chatuanin awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawvêl mi hausate chu inchhuang lo tûrin hrilh la, sum rin tlâk loh rin chhan tum lova engkim kan hman atâna min petu Pathianah innghat zâwk tûrin fuih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thil ṭha ti tûr te, thil ṭha tiha hausa tûr te, phal taka mi dangte sem ve chîng tûr tein fuih bawk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, nakin atân ro hlu tak an insiamsak a ni ang a, nunna tak tak chu an chang dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Timothe, i kova innghat hi vawng fimkhur hle ang che, ‘hriatna dik’ tia an chhâl, dik si lo, thu inkalh si, khawvêl mi tam takin an khûkpui ṭhin lakah khân inthiarfihlîm rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ṭhenkhat chuan an zâwm ve a, rinna kawng aṭangin an bo ta a ni. Pathian khawngaihna in hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
